From 9e629464425c8d197b5f04bdf12d69969b901b3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Micheal Waltz <services.claude@accounts.ecliptik.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 07:14:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [DOSKUTSU] patch 0302 -- the L3/Organya interlock reports
 INFO, not ERROR

Lever 3 (Pixtone IRQ-mix) is default-ON since v1.0.1 and Organya is a supported
backend, so the incompatible pair is reached by ordinary configuration rather
than by mistake. The interlock then behaves correctly: L3 is forced off for
hang prevention, SFX continue through SDL3_mixer, music continues through
Organya. Nothing is broken and nothing needs the operator's attention.

Logged at ERROR it fired on every Organya cell in the campaign and filled the
channel that gets scanned for genuine defects. A round-2 error sweep across all
four CPUs surfaced exactly two things: the Pixtone unrendered-slot spam fixed
in 0299, and this -- which was not a defect at all.

Severity only. The interlock, the message text and the hang prevention are
unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/sound/Pixtone.cpp | 10 +++++++++-
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/sound/Pixtone.cpp b/src/sound/Pixtone.cpp
index 13054e66..f802ddd8 100644
--- a/src/sound/Pixtone.cpp
+++ b/src/sound/Pixtone.cpp
@@ -1522,7 +1522,15 @@ void Pixtone::checkL3OrganyaInterlock()
   const bool bk_organya  = (bk && std::strcmp(bk, "organya") == 0);
   if (l3_on && bk_organya)
   {
-    LOG_ERROR("Lever 3 (Pixtone IRQ-mix; default ON since v1.0.1, or "
+    // DOS-PORT (patch 0302): INFO, not ERROR. This fires on EVERY Organya
+    // cell by design -- L3 is default-ON since v1.0.1 and Organya is a
+    // supported backend, so the pair is reached by ordinary configuration
+    // rather than by mistake. The interlock then does exactly what it is
+    // meant to: L3 off, SFX continue via SDL3_mixer, music via Organya.
+    // Nothing is broken and nothing needs the operator. At ERROR it filled
+    // the channel that gets scanned for real defects -- it was one of two
+    // findings a round-2 error sweep surfaced, and the only false one.
+    LOG_INFO("Lever 3 (Pixtone IRQ-mix; default ON since v1.0.1, or "
               "SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_PIXTONE_IRQ_MIX=1) is incompatible with "
               "SDL_HINT_DOSKUTSU_AUDIO_BACKEND=organya. L3 + ORGANYA IS "
               "KNOWN-INCOMPATIBLE (PLAY2 hang root-cause owned by v1.0.2 "
